<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>主页</title>
    <style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        background: #f0efeb;
        color: #222;
        font-family: "Microsoft YaHei", "PingFang SC", sans-serif;
        padding: 24px;
        margin: 0;
        zoom: 0.85;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 20px;
      }

      .box {
        border: 5px solid #2b2b2b;
        background: #f7f5f0;
        box-shadow: 0 6px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
      }

      .box-warning {
        border-color: #8b0000;
      }

      .box-header {
        background: #2b2b2b;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: bold;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 10px 0;
        position: relative;
      }

      .box-warning .box-header {
        background: #8b0000;
      }

      .big-tri {
        font-size: 60px;
        margin: 0 8px;
        vertical-align: middle;
      }

      .box-body {
        padding: 24px 28px;
        font-size: 18px;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .box-body hr {
        border: none;
        border-top: 1px solid #bbb;
        margin: 12px 0;
      }

      .lead {
        font-style: italic;
      }

      .count {
        color: #1a5fb4;
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 22px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="box box-welcome">
        <div class="box-header">
          <span class="big-tri">◣</span>
          WELCOME!
          <span class="big-tri">◥</span>
        </div>
        <div class="box-body">
          <span style="font-size: 26px;">欢迎来到“剧本之外”！</span>
          <hr />
          <p>
            这里是由作者【你的名字】创作的、世界观“你的世界”的官方WIKI。本WIKI上出现的内容均为官方设定，随时间推移或许会更新。
          </p>
          <p>网页中的内容可能含有系列游戏剧透，会提前在页面中标出。</p>
          <p>
            迄今为止，该WIKI共有 <span class="count">0</span> 个页面！哇哦！
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="box box-warning">
        <div class="box-header">
          <span class="big-tri">◣</span>
          WARNING!
          <span class="big-tri">◥</span>
        </div>
        <div class="box-body">
          <p class="lead">嘟……嘟……该页面尚在搭建中，请稍后再拨。</p>
          <p>
            预计下次翻新WIKI，时间：待定。好消息：游戏剧本要重写了！坏消息：还没开始写，怎么办呢。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
